    "layout": "Hook cards use the role-upgrade stack: eyebrow (INDIANAPOLIS SPORT PARENTS, white chip, top) → kicker (lead-in, above headline) → headline → subhead. cluster-43 is the stacked-hook template (A4/B1/D2). A hookRef auto-splits a 2–3 segment line across kicker/headline/subhead via splitHook; a copyRefs binds a single magnet to one slot.",
    "media": "EVERY creative is media-backed (hard rule 6). Statics set asset.media (./assets/conf-<id>.jpg); the runner injects it as a full-frame bg + legibility scrim + text shadows. Motion sets asset.clip. Distinct source per asset, no reuse.",
